* Sorted vs\nunsorted array
** Unsorted array
*** Insert at the end\nO(1)
*** Linear search O(n)
*** Remove needs a search
** Sorted array
*** Insert keeps order\nO(n)
*** Binary search\nO(log n)
*** Ordered traversal\nis free
** Operations compared
*** Insert an element
*** Remove an element
*** Search an element
** Conclusion
*** Read-heavy\n-> sorted
*** Write-heavy\n-> unsorted
